<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia to offer A$700 mln in T-bonds.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia to offer A$700 mln in T-bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Treasury will offer a total of A$700 million in Treasury bonds through a tender on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said.  </p>
<p>The offering will comprise A$300 million of 8.75 percent bonds maturing in January 2001 and A$400 million of 8.75 percent bonds maturing in August 2008.</p>
<p>The bank said bids would be received until 12.45 p.m. (0245 GMT) on Tuesday and results would be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0400 GMT). Settlement date is August 29.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
